( Contact springs in 2D, sideways load (conspr7 of the Professional with
  a horizontal force 0.5 on each top node). Without a friction record the
  friction is unlimited (manual 6.604) and the first tangential direction
  lies in the plane, so each spring carries -0.5 tangentially.
  Professional 02-08-2026: tangential force -0.5 in both springs, top disx 24.5.
  Before, GNU took f = 0 and a tangential direction along z (disx 1.5e12).
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_strain_total
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1  0.0 0
node 2  1.0 0
node 3  0.0 1
node 4  1.0 1
node 5  0.0 1
node 6  1.0 1
node 7  0 2
node 8  1 2
element 1  -quad4 1 2 3 4
element 2  -quad4 5 6 7 8
element 3  -contact_spring2 5 3
element_group 3 1
element 4  -contact_spring2 6 4
element_group 4 1
group_type 0  -materi
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young  0  1.
group_type 1  -contact_spring
group_contact_spring_stiffness 1 1.e6 1.
group_contact_spring_direction_automatic 1 -yes

bounda_dof     10  -ra 1 2 -ra -velx -vely
bounda_force   20  -ra 7 8 -ra -vely
bounda_time    20  1.
bounda_force   21  -ra 7 8 -ra -velx
bounda_time    21  0.5
control_timestep 0  1. 1.
target_item    1  -element_contact_spring_force 3 1
target_value   1  -0.5 1.e-8
target_item    2  -element_contact_spring_force 4 1
target_value   2  -0.5 1.e-8
target_item    3  -element_contact_spring_force 3 0
target_value   3  2.000000000280 1.e-8
target_item    4  -node_dof 7 -disx
target_value   4  24.500002 1.e-5
end_data
